<title>UK: SOCCER-LEONHARDSEN MOVES TO LIVERPOOL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEONHARDSEN MOVES TO LIVERPOOL.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL, England 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norwegian midfielder Oyvind Leonhardsen signed for Liverpool on Monday in a four million pound ($6.5 million) move from Wimbledon.</p>
<p>Leonhardsen, 26, said he had had several offers but Liverpool attracted him most.</p>
<p>The Norwegian, who helped his country to a 4-2 win over Brazil last Friday, had played for Wimbledon since October 1994.</p>
